text BLUE PORTS ARE ANCHORS. AIM AT ONE AND HOLD {jack}.\nYOU HANG. {left}/{right} PUMPS THE SWING. {up}/{down} REELS.\nLET GO AT THE TOP OF THE SWING TO FLY.
text THIS RAIL STOPS HALFWAY. THE PIT DOESN'T.\nDRIVE TO THE END, THEN FIND ANOTHER WAY ACROSS.\nTHERE IS ALWAYS A PORT. LOOK UP.
entity {"type": "anchor", "x": 18, "y": 10}
